{"id":"74864270657b435d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-universal-tm.md","title":"Universal Turing Machine","display":"df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-universal-tm","aliases":["88-df-universal-tm"],"display":"df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-tm-output]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-universal-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-universal-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-universal-tm-—-Universal-Turing-Machine-$U$\">df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为固定的有效二进制输入机器族，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a>。这不自动要求覆盖全部具有任意输出字母表的机器。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing-machine class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x),\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x),\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (binary word codes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}\\)</span> (halting predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}\\)</span> (partial output function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span> (universality predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\leftrightarrow\nU\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\Sigma_U=\\{0,1\\}\n\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Output}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\n=\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\leftrightarrow\nU\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\Sigma_U=\\{0,1\\}\n\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Output}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\n=\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e))\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e))\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 对编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_e)\">\\((M_e)\\)</span> 的通用性</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e\">\\(M_e\\)</span> : 编号为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>的Turing机</li>\n<li>本原子只定义通用性谓词；通用机的存在性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"74c3063d074d3786\" href=\"?note=74c3063d074d3786\" title=\"88-prop-universal-tm\">88-prop-universal-tm</a> 断言。</li>\n<li>自然数参数先经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}\\)</span> 变成机器输入词，避免把数码与词类型混用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-universal-tm-—-Universal-Turing-Machine-$U$","text":"df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine $U$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-output","status":"resolved","id":"fff1247dc8d93b4d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-output]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-description-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c5514506c707c9ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-description-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c5514506c707c9ae","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ 为固定的有效二进制输入机器族，满足 $\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)$，见 [[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]。这不自动要求覆盖全部具有任意输出字母表的机器。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ (Turing-machine class, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","exc